{"title":"Patching the Wagon","html":"<article class=\"wp g-page\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"wp-lede\"><span class=\"q-alert-banner\" role=\"alert\"><svg class=\"q-alert-ico\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 3 2 21h20z\" fill=\"currentColor\"/><path d=\"M12 10v5M12 17.6v.4\" stroke=\"#1b1300\" stroke-width=\"2.2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/></svg><span><b>This quest is not fully written yet.</b> Steps, items or dialogue may be missing.</span></span>Ivy Stoke has dug the axles of the bleached wagon out of the sand and wants a wagon of her own for the Agauton road.</p><section id=\"g-about\"><h2>About</h2><div class=\"g-scroll\"><table class=\"g-table q-facts\"><thead><tr><th></th><th></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Given by</td><td>Ivy Stoke</td></tr><tr><td>Level</td><td>20</td></tr><tr><td>Length</td><td>Long</td></tr><tr><td>Kind</td><td>Side</td></tr><tr><td>Quest points</td><td>1</td></tr></tbody></table></div></section><section id=\"g-needs\"><h2>What you need</h2><ul class=\"q-needs\"><li><a href=\"#/item/chitin-plate\"><img class=\"g-ico\" src=\"data/img/e7a114aeae3b63b5e56d.svg\" alt=\"\">Chitin Plate</a> <b>×8</b></li><li><a href=\"#/item/pit-mother-carapace\"><img class=\"g-ico\" src=\"data/img/126d43568af7c0d1cc65.svg\" alt=\"\">Pit Mother Carapace</a> <b>×1</b></li></ul></section><section id=\"g-steps\"><h2>Steps</h2><ol class=\"q-steps\"><li value=\"1\">Talk to Ivy Stoke to get the quest.</li><li value=\"2\">Bring Oren Mace 8 chitin plates <span class=\"muted\">(8)</span> - <a href=\"#/item/chitin-plate\"><img class=\"g-ico\" src=\"data/img/e7a114aeae3b63b5e56d.svg\" alt=\"\">Chitin Plate</a> <span class=\"muted\">at 556, 670</span> <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"spot\" data-map-id=\"556|670|Bring Oren Mace 8 chitin plates\">Show on map</button></li><li value=\"3\">Kill the Pit Mother <span class=\"muted\">at 330, 571</span> <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"spot\" data-map-id=\"330|571|Kill the Pit Mother\">Show on map</button><br>Bring Oren Mace the Pit Mother&#39;s carapace - <a href=\"#/item/pit-mother-carapace\"><img class=\"g-ico\" src=\"data/img/126d43568af7c0d1cc65.svg\" alt=\"\">Pit Mother Carapace</a> <span class=\"muted\">at 556, 671</span> <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"spot\" data-map-id=\"556|671|Bring Oren Mace the Pit Mother&#39;s carapace\">Show on map</button></li></ol></section><section id=\"g-rewards\"><h2>Rewards</h2><div class=\"g-scroll\"><table class=\"g-table q-rewards\"><thead><tr><th>Reward</th><th></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Gold</td><td>1,600</td></tr><tr><td>Character XP</td><td>50,000</td></tr><tr><td>Quest points</td><td>1</td></tr></tbody></table></div></section><section id=\"g-talk\"><h2>What Ivy Stoke says</h2><div class=\"q-conv\"><p class=\"q-npc\"><b>Oren Mace:</b> Good plates. That&#39;s the sides done.</p><p class=\"q-npc\"><b>Oren Mace:</b> The front is the problem. That&#39;s where the arrows land, and a small plate cracks there. You want one piece as wide as the wagon.</p><p class=\"q-npc\"><b>Oren Mace:</b> The Pit Mother in the middle hollow at the Antlion Pits has a back like that. I know it&#39;s a lot to ask.</p></div></section></div>\n      <aside class=\"wp-infobox g-aside\"><h3>Patching the Wagon</h3><p class=\"g-aside-group\">Quests</p><p class=\"g-aside-h\">On this page</p><ol class=\"g-toc\"><li><a href=\"#/guide/quest-wastelands-patching-the-wagon\" data-g-jump=\"g-about\">About</a></li><li><a href=\"#/guide/quest-wastelands-patching-the-wagon\" data-g-jump=\"g-needs\">What you need</a></li><li><a href=\"#/guide/quest-wastelands-patching-the-wagon\" data-g-jump=\"g-steps\">Steps</a></li><li><a href=\"#/guide/quest-wastelands-patching-the-wagon\" data-g-jump=\"g-rewards\">Rewards</a></li><li><a href=\"#/guide/quest-wastelands-patching-the-wagon\" data-g-jump=\"g-talk\">What Ivy Stoke says</a></li></ol><p class=\"g-aside-h\">Related guides</p><ul class=\"g-toc\"><li><a href=\"#/guide/quests\">All quests</a></li><li><a href=\"#/guide/travel\">Travel &amp; quests</a></li></ul><p class=\"g-aside-h\"><a href=\"#/guides\">All guides</a></p><p class=\"g-note\">From the game’s own data, what players have recorded, and the <a href=\"https://binxonia.com/guide\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">official guide</a>.</p></aside></article>"}